        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And if his oblation be a goat, then he shall offer it before Jehovah: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and he shall lay his hand upon the head of it, and kill it before the tent of meeting; and the sons of Aaron shall sprinkle the blood thereof upon the altar round about. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he shall offer thereof his oblation, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " an offering made by fire unto Jehovah; the fat that covereth the inwards, and all the fat that is upon the inwards, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the two kidneys, and the fat that is upon them, which is by the loins, and the caul upon the liver, with the kidneys, shall he take away. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the priest shall burn them upon the altar: it is the food of the offering made by fire, for a sweet savor; all the fat is Jehovah’s. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It shall be a perpetual statute throughout your generations in all your dwellings, that ye shall eat neither fat nor blood.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
